{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22125","headline":"赠能七伦 · 白居易","name":"赠能七伦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"涧松高百寻，四时寒森森。\n临风有清韵，向日无曲阴。\n如何时俗人，但赏桃李林。\n岂不知坚贞，芳馨诱其心。\n能生学爲文，气高功亦深。\n手中一百篇，句句披沙金。\n苦节二十年，无人振陆沈。\n今我尚贫贱，徒爲尔知音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22125.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22125","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}